.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct nvme_cdp_change_event" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct nvme_cdp_change_event \- CDP Change Event Data Format (Event Type 0Fh)
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct nvme_cdp_change_event {
.br
.BI "    __u8 ps;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 perid;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 rsvd2[10];"
.br
.BI "    __u8 ped[];"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "ps" 12
Personality Status, see \fIenum nvme_cdp_change_event_ps\fP.
.IP "perid" 12
Personality Identifier of the personality whose settings a Set
Features command requested to change, see \fIenum
nvme_personality_identifier\fP.
.IP "rsvd2" 12
Reserved
.IP "ped" 12
Personality Event Data: the data buffer of the Set Features
command corresponding to \fIperid\fP, if any.
